    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Become a Whale?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;whale&quot; refers to someone who spends an outrageous amount of money on online games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may be scorned for wasting money, but in the game world, their overwhelming strength earns admiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simulation game where you can experience life as one of these legendary whales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on part-time jobs, start a company, earn money, and sink it all into a virtual social game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events will occur around the city. Complete them to earn valuable rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work and Earn Money!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/a73bcab3bc1146a9c1c92ec5beced778.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/a73bcab3bc1146a9c1c92ec5beced778.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/a73bcab3bc1146a9c1c92ec5beced778.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of job options are available. Find the one you like and start making money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up Your Skills and Get Promoted!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1e1b84e89060b2d8cef2f836add859f.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1e1b84e89060b2d8cef2f836add859f.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1e1b84e89060b2d8cef2f836add859f.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skill levels to earn more income from your jobs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Own Business!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/9aa922d5dac6f13954ad4f6909cc247f.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/9aa922d5dac6f13954ad4f6909cc247f.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/9aa922d5dac6f13954ad4f6909cc247f.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also start and manage your own company to generate higher profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Talented Employees!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/360e9860db3e1e526e1dab32227fd0cd.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/360e9860db3e1e526e1dab32227fd0cd.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/360e9860db3e1e526e1dab32227fd0cd.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiring skilled workers will boost your business\u2019s earnings even further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Big in Online Games!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1528dc0c721d7a4a19c3f482a0c6507.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1528dc0c721d7a4a19c3f482a0c6507.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f1528dc0c721d7a4a19c3f482a0c6507.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to spin the gacha and collect powerful characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Rankings!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f754b998c6c7c63736edde6f4b9f3012.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f754b998c6c7c63736edde6f4b9f3012.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/f754b998c6c7c63736edde6f4b9f3012.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival whales await in the online game world. Use your spending power to crush the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome gameplay videos, streams, and let's plays of this game. Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations are free to create content without restriction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the link to the Steam store page in the description of your video or stream.</p>",
